		Consequently, if $h$ is $x$-nonzero, then
		\begin{align}
			&\nu^{-1/2}\|\mathrm e^{3\gamma\nu^{1/3}t}\nabla(\kappa h)\|_{L_t^2L_x^2}
			\nonumber\\
			&\qquad\leq C\bigl(E_{1}(T)+\frac{\varepsilon}{\nu}\bigr)
