weight calculation proves \eqref{eq:mnu-first-power-revised}.

For the forcing multipliers, \eqref{eq:anis-prod-L2},
$H^2(\mathbb R^2)\hookrightarrow L^\infty$, and $h_{0}=0$ give
\begin{equation*}
