		The regular terms are integrated using \eqref{eq:0neq-time-ZU1}--\eqref{eq:0neq-time-RU0}; they contribute at most $C(E_{2}/\nu)E_{6}$ to the first two norms and a smaller $C\nu^{-2/3}E_{2}E_{6}$ to the weak norm. Since $\mu_\nu\geq\nu^{2/3}$,
